-- FG circuit pilot S2s: port of Tools.ShippingFGCircuitS2hHist onto the context-predicate bundles (RefLawsAOpsX / RefLawsATeleX); generated by a rename-only script (names + suffix X, `AdmCtx O.quiet` -> `O.adm`). No sorry/axiom/native_decide/TRUSTED/law.

set_option autoImplicit false
-- FG circuit pilot S2h (part 1): a HISTORY invariant `JQHX` for the child cache — every cache entry carries the evidence `E` that held at the start of the run that created it. No `sorry`, no `axiom`, no `native_decide`, no TRUSTED, no new law. Results: docs/FG-CIRCUIT-PILOT.md §34.
-- `RealChildAX`, `JQCX`, `CacheInvAX` and every lemma about them are UNCHANGED; this file ADDS `RealChildEX`, `CacheEX`, `JQHX` and the versions of the cache/entry lemmas that need the invariant (copies of ShippingChildCacheA / ShippingChildCoreC with `JQCX` ↦ `JQHX`; the only new proof steps are the cache clear (`CacheEX {}`), the miss insert (the evidence is taken from the miss premise `MissEX`) and the hit (the evidence is read from the cache entry)).

